omer Competitor”) with a PU under the terms of this Appendix except, at the date set out in Article 1.2.1 of this Appendix above:\n\nSuch Competitor has entered into a supply agreement with a PU Manufacturer for year N before the date set out in Article 1.2.1 of this Appendix above, and\n\n2026 Formula 1 Regulations: Technical Regulations  \n©2025 Fédération Internationale de l’Automobile\n\n10 December 2025  \nIssue 15\n\nC254--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBaillie Gifford European Growth Trust plc Vote Disclosure* (https://www.bailliegifford.com/en/uk/intermediaries/literature-library/funds/investment-trusts/european-growth-trust/vote-disclosures/baillie-gifford-european-growth-trust-vote-disclosure-q4-2025/)\nciteturn42search15 [wordlim: 200] Published: 7 months ago; 14 November 2025 1.3.2 ... 10 December 2025 1a.\n** AGM = Annual General Meeting; EGM = Extraordinary General Meeting; SGM = Special General Meeting; CRT = Court Meeting; OTH = \nOther Meeting; CLS = Class Meeting\nCompany\nMeeting Type Meeting Date\nResolution Proposal\nProposal Type\nVote Cast\nReason\nAutoStore Hdgs\nEGM\n17 October 2025 1\nRoutine Business\nManagement\nFor\nAutoStore Hdgs\nEGM\n17 October 2025 2\nRoutine Business\nManagement\nFor\nAutoStore Hdgs\nEGM\n17 October 2025 3\nRoutine Business\nManagement\nFor\nAutoStore Hdgs\nEGM\n17 October 2025 4\nElect Director(s)\nManagement\nFor\nAutoStore Hdgs\nEGM\n17 October 2025 5\nNon-Executive Remuneration\nManagement\nAgainst\nWe opposed non-executive remuneration \ndue to concerns that the two-year vesting \nperiod attached to the equity grants may \naffect the independent judgement of non-\nexecutive directors.\nVend Marketplaces ASEGM\n22 October 2025 1\nRoutine Business\nManagement\nFor\nVend Marketplaces ASEGM\n22 October 2025 2\nRoutine Business\nManagement\nFor\nVend Marketplaces ASEGM\n22 October 2025 3\nRoutine Business\nManagement\nFor\nVend Marketplaces ASEGM\n22 October 2025 4